flowchart TB
  subgraph BIZ[业务入口与业务域]
    MS[主 Session 对话与工具]
    VE[视频探索：手动查看 / 定时 runDuty]
    CM[评论通知：@ / 回复 / 自己楼层]
    DM[私信收件箱]
    SI[好友推荐与主动社交]
    DY[每日动态]
    ER[情绪回顾]
    PL[自主计划与待办]
    TL[真实生活时间线 / 管理中心]
    MM[梗知识学习与检索]
  end

  subgraph ID[身份与通道权限层]
    FD[friendDirectory]
    ST[socialTier：owner / friend / stranger]
    CH[通道开关与兼容镜像：dmWhitelist / commentAtWhitelist / mentionTargets]
    OI[主人身份：dmOwnerUid + 主 Session 绑定]
  end

  subgraph CTX[上下文与记忆读取层]
    MR[memoryRetriever：retrieve / localContext / socialContext]
    VC[commentVideoContext：视频 / 字幕 / 楼层 / 热评]
    ML[interactionMemeLookup：梗知识]
    PC[角色上下文：persona / growth / personality / emotion]
    FR[好友画像：friendLearning / friendRelationships]
    LG[lifeMemoryGateway：按场景授权的证据读取]
  end

  subgraph ORCH[编排与状态层]
    IB[interactionBatcher：普通 DM / 评论生成队列]
    OCA[ownerCommentAgent：主人 / 可信好友评论专用流程]
    ODA[ownerDmAgent：主人私信任务 Agent]
    SCH[interactionScheduler：DM + 评论轮询]
    LMC[LifeMemoryCoordinator：人生经历 outbox]
    LRF[LifeReflection：候选反思与投影]
    LTM[LongTermMemory：身份记忆写入 / 额度 / 暂存]
    CONS[MemoryConsolidator：主人聊天记忆压缩]
  end

  subgraph MODEL[模型与执行安全层]
    INV[invokeInteractionPrompt / invokeMemoryPrompt]
    SEC[headless-security：安全 overlay / 启动校验]
    DUTY[runDuty：视频 Agent 专用 headless profile]
    WATCH[executeWatchVideo：手动读取与记录]
    RUNLOG[runDuty 本地 seen / report 结果]
    COLLECT[collectRealLife：定时收集本地记录]
    MCP[Bili MCP：工具适配与 Python _guard]
    WGUARD[业务写入闸门：人工确认 / owner 授权 / 额度 / 回执]
    DYP[daily-dynamic-publish.py：独立发布闸门]
  end

  MS --> OI
  MS --> MR
  MS --> LTM
  MS --> PC
  MS --> WGUARD
  WGUARD --> MCP

  VE --> DUTY
  VE --> WATCH
  DUTY --> MR
  DUTY --> PC
  DUTY --> SEC
  DUTY --> MCP
  MCP --> RUNLOG --> COLLECT --> LMC
  WATCH --> MCP
  WATCH --> LMC

  CM --> SCH
  DM --> SCH
  SCH --> FD
  FD --> ST
  FD --> CH
  SCH --> OCA
  SCH --> ODA
  SCH --> VC
  SCH --> IB
  VC --> IB
  MR --> IB
  ML --> IB
  PC --> IB
  FR --> IB
  IB --> INV
  OCA --> VC
  OCA --> MR
  OCA --> INV
  ODA --> OI
  ODA --> INV
  INV --> SEC
  OCA --> WGUARD
  ODA --> WGUARD
  IB --> WGUARD
  WGUARD --> MCP
  MCP --> LMC

  SI --> FD
  SI --> FR
  SI --> INV
  SI --> WGUARD
  WGUARD --> MCP

  DY --> LG
  DY --> INV
  DY --> DYP
  ER --> LG
  ER --> LTM
  ER --> INV
  ER --> MS

  LMC --> LG
  LMC --> LRF
  LRF --> LG
  LRF --> LTM
  LRF --> PC
  LTM --> MR
  LTM --> CONS
  CONS --> LTM

  PL --> OI
  PL --> INV
  PL --> WGUARD
  WGUARD --> MCP

  TL --> LG
  TL --> FR
  MM --> ML
  MM --> MEMMODEL[专用梗规则模型任务]

